<refnamediv>
  <refname><varname>SilikoVersionString</varname></refname>
  <refpurpose>String holding full version number</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Version.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">extern const char SilikoVersionString[];</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <varname>SilikoVersionString</varname> value contains a string
with the version (major.minor.patch) and prerelease suffix.</para>
